{"id": "Dfbxw0zSmux", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "When Shiva drank the halahala poison, who saved Him? 🌙 The story of Maa Tara, the Mother who saw Mahadev as her own child.\n\nAt the churning of the ocean, Bhagwan Shiv held the halahala for the good of all the worlds. It burned in His throat and began to spread. Maa Bhagwati could not bear it. She took the form of Maa Tara, seated Him in her lap, and saw not the god of gods but her own little one. Her milk cut the poison and cooled Him.\n\nThis is how Maa Tara is remembered at Tarapith in Bengal, where the original stone murti in the sanctum shows her as a mother nursing Shiva.\n\nFor a mother there is no difference between Mahadev and any of her children. Whoever comes to her in pain, she takes it away. 🙏\n\n🎙️ Voice & story: @shagunshrotriyaparashar_\n🎨 Art & animation: @therishikatha\n\nSave this for anyone who needs a mother’s blessing today, and share it with your Maa. 💙\nComment “Jai Maa Tara” 🌺\n\n#maatara #tarapith #jaimaatara #mahavidya #dasmahavidya shiva mahadev neelkanth halahal samudramanthan shakti hindumythology sanatandharma bengal devotional", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1794041028, "like_count": 1091, "comment_count": 28, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2238870433350026a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.469, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMU8GYoNePcq2OB67uc1ykMuqy9qmUFznp9U4mA4UsPMU4NK1TZSVWYoUGfFChTTiKzcjJiaPVh0jZeC595UW7fWzIO9s4aFB37ldw.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdpH47eEG_cHWp9kzc6WE2d71Y_qe1IUZrMQW05It_tbTyqxnndAj016BRezqkDV-6QR0FOOHK8vqjZ9QJxqX9Bd&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=cecpVo9DQeEQ7kNvwFVTbTO&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=wZSIteip9Cemi1AjwU_LRw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketl